\caption{Measured FEL gain curves (a) and spectra (b) for direct amplification of deep ultraviolet free-electron laser. (averaged over 100 consecutive shots). The inset in (a) shows measured FEL transverse spot. Measured longitudinal phase spaces of the electron beam by the S-band deflecting cavity at the undulators exit: (c) seed laser off; (d) seed laser on.}
