With a seed laser delivering 5.7 MW peak power ($8.06 \times 10^7 \mathrm{~W} / \mathrm{cm}^2$), pulse energies measured 5.7 microjoules at the undulator entrance and 0.13 microjoules at the exit in the absence of the electron beam.

