{
\includegraphics[scale=0.35]{Figure6.png}
}
\caption{Scaled magnetic energies $\langle\bm{B}\cdot\hat{\bm{L}}\rangle/\alpha$ as a function of $\alpha$. Magnetic energies at, (a)-(c) the $\bm{\Gamma}$ point, and (d)-(f) the $\bm{M}$ point. The central band (red), first remote band (green), and second remote band (purple) are indicated. There is a clear interplay between bands in the hybridization regions. Magic angles (Black vertical lines) and topological phase transitions (black and orange dashed lines) are indicated.}
