We now turn to find the effective in-plane Stokes equations.
 Integrating the in-plane Stokes equation (Eq. \eqref{stokesequa}) between the two free surfaces, and applying the stress free boundary conditions, we find an effective Stokes equation along the $\textbf{e}_1$ and $\textbf{e}_2$ directions. These read
