\subsubsection{Performance and Robustness Comparison}

To comprehensively evaluate the optimization performance of the proposed GADSG algorithm in task offloading and resource allocation within LAENet-based MEC systems, we conduct comparative experiments against four baseline methods (RE, AO, GRLO, and GDSG) across eight test datasets of varying scales and topologies. Two evaluation metrics—average cost ratio and cost accuracy rate—are adopted to assess the optimization effectiveness and robustness of the algorithms. Table~\ref{tab:cost_ratio} presents a comparison of the average cost ratio achieved by different methods, while Table~\ref{tab:cost_accuracy} reports the results of the cost accuracy rate for each method.



