requires more manipulations, which is as follows:
%
\begin{align}
 &\mJ^{[1]}(\hf^{(0)},\hf^{(0)})  \\
=&\mG
 \int \alpha_i[\frac{\partial \hf_*^{(0)\prime}}{\partial x_i}\hf^{(0)\prime}
              +\frac{\partial \hf_*^{(0)}}{\partial x_i}\hf^{(0)}]
      \frac{\hV_\alpha\theta(\hV_\alpha)}{2\sqrt{2\pi}}d\Omega(\bm{\alpha})d\bz_* \notag\\
